 """
 Tableau Prep Script step  ->  replaces / reproduces the CL_orders clean step.
 
 In Tableau Prep:  IN_orders  ->  [+] Script
     Connection type : Tableau Python (TabPy) Server   (localhost : 9004)
     File name       : prep_orders_kpis.py
